  "brief": {
    "zh": "带着两只兰花箱到南门集合。顶层踏板切断第一道折光幕。中层东端的踏板切断第二道。花箱在底层两头，开一只用一回合。限 88 回合。",
    "en": "Bring both orchid chests to the south gate. The top terrace plate cuts the first bent light curtain. A second plate at the east end of the middle terrace cuts the other curtain. The chests stand at opposite ends of the lowest terrace. Opening a chest takes one turn. Finish within 88 turns."
